# Prevents core.autocrlf on some future checkout from rewriting LF to CRLF in served static assets --
# harmless for most files here, but this repo now also carries files that get hashed/compared byte-for-byte
# in other parts of the TourGuid estate (see TourGuid-App's own .gitattributes for the version of this
# problem that actually bit something). Cheap to apply broadly rather than re-discover per file later.
public/** text eol=lf
